@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

# Auth: cookie OR Bearer - server checks Cookie first, then Bearer
# Use either: Cookie: token={{token}} OR Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Verify - Logged User (optionalAuth - cookie OR Bearer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "text": "Hadith text to verify",
  "explanation": "optional explanation"
}

### Get Verify - Guest (no token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hadith text to verify"
}
